xbvp63.png/80px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E5%AE%88%E6%8A%A4%E9%93%83%E5%85%B0%E4%B9%8B%E5%89%91.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/6/60/8djuio2akepzu7fotw9w9q7dzxbvp63.png/120px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E5%AE%88%E6%8A%A4%E9%93%83%E5%85%B0%E4%B9%8B%E5%89%91.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/6/60/8djuio2akepzu7fotw9w9q7dzxbvp63.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><br />守护铃兰之剑\n</th>\n<td class=\"text-left text-nowrap\" style=\"width:10%;\"><center><b>&#160;技能类别<br /></b>[职业技能]</center>\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:70%;\">&#160;\n<p>（被动）若自身范围<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>格内有<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>名及以上友军，自身受到伤害降低<font color=\"#ed7950\">20%</font>，攻击提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">20%</font>；造成物理伤害后，把目标<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>个[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">增益</span>]转换为随机[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"2级属性减益\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">2级属性减益</font></span></span>]，持续<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>回合。击退目标时，击退距离增加<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>格。\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\">可习得该技能的角色\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\"><b>门外</b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div>\n<div class=\"hero_head\" style=\"width:70px;height:70px;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head_img\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E4%BC%8A%E5%8D%97%E5%A8%9C%C2%B7%E9%93%83%E5%85%B0%E4%B9%8B%E5%89%91\" title=\"角色图鉴库/伊南娜·铃兰之剑\"><img alt=\"头像 伊南娜·铃兰之剑.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/9/95/7xf56pp71w2r9qrvn7pxbqra09q6el9.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"70\" height=\"70\" class=\"img-kk\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></a></div>\n<div class